    {
      "paper_id": "doi:10.1016/j.jet.2026.106182",
      "sequence": 9,
      "source_sequence": 9,
      "article_type": "research-article",
      "title_en": "Information design with endogenous state verification",
      "title_cn": "具有内生状态验证的信息设计",
      "authors": [
        "Lily Ling Yang"
      ],
      "abstract_en": "We study a persuasion problem in which the receiver has the ability to probabilistically verify the state at a cost. The sender wants to convince the receiver to accept a project, but the receiver is only willing to accept the project when its quality is above a threshold. The optimal disclosure policy strikes a balance between influencing the receiver’s decisions to accept and to verify the quality. It is deterministic and involves at most three messages, each consisting of an acceptance recommendation and a verification recommendation. Under the optimal disclosure policy, the acceptance recommendation exhibits a cutoff structure, while the verification recommendation exhibits a negative assortative structure. Specifically, the optimal disclosure policy recommends acceptance when the quality exceeds a certain threshold. When the quality falls below this threshold, rejection without verification is recommended. For qualities above the threshold, verification is not recommended if the quality lies within the middle range of the interval. Using the characterization of the optimal disclosure policy, we conduct comparative statics and show that verification is recommended when the probability of successful verification is moderate.",
      "abstract_cn": "我们研究了一个说服问题，其中接收者能够以一定成本对状态进行概率性验证。发送者希望说服接收者接受一个项目，但接收者仅在项目质量高于某一阈值时才愿意接受该项目。最优披露策略在影响接收者接受决策与验证质量决策之间取得平衡。该策略是确定性的，最多包含三条信息，每条信息包括一个接受建议和一个验证建议。在最优披露策略下，接受建议呈现截断结构，而验证建议呈现负配对结构。具体而言，当质量超过某一阈值时，最优披露策略建议接受；当质量低于该阈值时，建议拒绝且不进行验证。对于高于阈值的质量，如果质量位于区间的中间范围内，则不建议进行验证。利用最优披露策略的特征，我们进行了比较静态分析，结果表明当成功验证的概率处于中等水平时，建议进行验证。",
      "abstract_snippet_en": "",
      "doi": "10.1016/j.jet.2026.106182",
      "source_url": "https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0022053126000463?dgcid=rss_sd_all",
