    {
      "paper_id": "doi:10.1016/j.jet.2026.106183",
      "sequence": 14,
      "source_sequence": 14,
      "article_type": "research-article",
      "title_en": "Localized perfection",
      "title_cn": "局部完美均衡",
      "authors": [
        "Enxian Chen",
        "Lei Qiao",
        "Xiang Sun",
        "Yeneng Sun"
      ],
      "abstract_en": "Perfect equilibrium and its refinements are widely studied and typically rely on full-support perturbations. We introduce a δ-localized notion of perfection for games with a continuum of players. It confines perturbations within a δ-neighborhood of the underlying action distribution and eliminates undesirable equilibria from a local perspective. We establish the existence of a pure strategy δ-localized perfect equilibrium and show that it is equivalent to δ-admissible Nash equilibrium. We also study limit versions of δ-localized perfection. Illustrative applications to large routing games and crowd saturation games are presented.",
      "abstract_cn": "完美均衡及其精炼概念被广泛研究，通常依赖于全支持扰动。我们引入了适用于具有连续玩家的博弈的δ-局部完美概念。该概念将扰动限制在基础行动分布的δ邻域内，并从局部视角消除不良均衡。我们证明了纯策略δ-局部完美均衡的存在性，并表明其等价于δ-可接受纳什均衡。我们还研究了δ-局部完美的极限版本。文中展示了该概念在大规模路径选择博弈和人群饱和博弈中的应用示例。",
      "abstract_snippet_en": "",
      "doi": "10.1016/j.jet.2026.106183",
